Hi fellow builders!

We have some really cool news for you, today we launched the page for the new "Diorama Builder" DLC, a new diorama in space, the...

https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/35020302/a946f1c5dfca6a4f05c41d67d2682cd8230bbc30.png

In this new DLC, the player will come across a real exploration colony on Mars. In this diorama, the player will set up:

 Workshop for vehicles,;
 Greenhouse for growing plants;
 Rocket with its launch tower;
 Exploration truck;
 Power station;
 Control tower;
 And much more!

Click on the link below to find out more about the DLC and don't forget to add it to your WISHLIST to be notified when it is released.

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2777590/Diorama_Builder__Mars_Colony/

For those who have been off the planet this last month, we want to let you know that we also have two more DLCs already released:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668590/Diorama_Builder__Medieval_Castle/

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2777580/Diorama_Builder__Noir_City/

Thank you very much for being part of the VIRTUAL ARTS STUDIO and DIORAMA BUILDER community!

And to not miss the news, follow our Steam developers page:
https://store.steampowered.com/developer/virtualartsstudio
